{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“连续上同调”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"连续上同调"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>连续上同调是用连续上圈定义的上同调, 或连续函数层的"},{"Local":{"url":"层上同调","text":"层上同调"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>由长正合列\n$$\r\n\\dots \\to H^2(X, \\mathbb{Z}) \\to H^2(X, \\mathbb{R}) \\to H^2(X, U(1)) \\to H^3(X, \\mathbb{Z}) \\to H^3(X, \\mathbb{R}) \\to \\dots\r\n$$\n可得连续上同调 $H^2(X,U(1))$ 同构于 $H^3(X,\\mathbb{R})$.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"奇异上同调","text":"奇异上同调"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}